id=firecube_lldv
name=Fire TV Cube 3 - Dolby Vision (LLDV) on non-DV displays
version=v0.3.2
versionCode=8
author=firecubev3_magisk_dv
description=Adds a Dolby Vision VSVDB (as an extra CTA EDID block) when the connected display reports no DV, and re-applies it after hotplug, standby wake and display power cycles. Gazelle (Fire TV Cube 3) only.
